nd rocks.","hold":true},"sentences":[{"role":"hook","text":"If you light a fire on a tall tower, you have a lighthouse."},{"role":"problem","text":"But the wind on top blows the flame out."},{"role":"fix1","text":"So you close the flame inside a glass room."},{"role":"problem2","text":"But now its glow is weak and spreads every way."},{"role":"fix2","text":"So you add a lens, invented in 1822, that bends the glow into beams."},{"role":"name","text":"This is a Fresnel lens."},{"role":"how","text":"The lens turns, and its beam is seen about 20 miles out to sea."},{"role":"problem3","text":"But now the heavy lens grinds as it turns."},{"role":"fix3","text":"So you float it on liquid mercury, and it spins easily."},{"role":"finish","text":"Add stairs to the door and rocks around the base."},{"role":"congrats","text":"Congratulations, you have built a lighthouse."}]}